@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 18
}

actor "Initial System\nAdministrator" as InitialAdmin
actor Admin
actor Technician
actor "Registration Staff" as RegistrationStaff
actor "Monitor Staff" as MonitorStaff

rectangle "RFID-Tagged\nHospital Assets" as Assets
cloud "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
cloud "Hospital Wi-Fi /\nNetwork" as Network

rectangle "Hospital Fixed-Asset Tracking System\n--\nRegisters and monitors RFID-tagged hospital assets,\nmanages sensor nodes and movement requests,\nand provides live asset and node status updates." as System

InitialAdmin --> System : First-admin setup
System --> InitialAdmin : Setup result

Admin --> System : Manage users, nodes,\nassets, movements, settings
System --> Admin : Status, alerts,\nand operation results

Technician --> System : Configure and manage nodes
System --> Technician : Node status and\ncommand results

RegistrationStaff --> System : Register assets,\nderegister assets,\napprove/reject movements
System --> RegistrationStaff : Scanned tags,\nasset data, pending requests

MonitorStaff --> System : Monitor assets and nodes,\nrequest movements
System --> MonitorStaff : Locations, alerts,\nand activity logs

Assets --> System : RFID tag signals\nand detections

System <--> MQTT : Scans, detections,\nheartbeats, commands,\nacknowledgements

Network <--> System : Connectivity for\napps and sensor nodes

@enduml